    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You tap into the tranquility of the elements. You know the @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplElementali]{Elementalism} cantrip. In addition, you can expend a use of your Rage to cast @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplDaylight00]{Daylight}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplWaterWalk0]{Water Walk}, or @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.spells24.Item.phbsplWindWall00]{Wind Wall}. Wisdom is your spellcasting ability for these spells.</p><section class=\"secret\" id=\"secret-97YhZSRLSUYbBErT\"><p><strong>Foundry Note</strong></p><p>Cast Daylight, Water Walk, or Wind Wall from your sheet after <em>Expend a Rage</em> spends a use of your Rage.</p></section>",
